  "content": "<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/articles/28-otherworldly-paranormal-tidbits-thatll-110000302.html#article-container\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Skip to main</a></li></ul><a href=\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/cracked/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6145a18784d4f7a89d61cf2e46186d117f8c8441a8e7688b2cb125865c4947ed/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_h100%3Bquality_100%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2025-04%2F0d419b70-1198-11f0-9dbd-ea4fcd19b225\" alt=\"Cracked\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"234\" height=\"100\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/db6a506db1614f49f3f392995a00f51ae88647203de95c1c75496a58aa19fa76/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_h100%3Bquality_100%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2025-04%2F266a7ea0-1198-11f0-aeff-c0a6c30fc473\" alt=\"Cracked\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"234\" height=\"100\" /></p></a><p>Jay Wells L'Ecuyer</p><p><time datetime=\"2026-10-26T11:00:00.000Z\">Mon, October 26, 2026 at 11:00 AM UTC</time></p><p>1 min read</p><p>If you've ever been out on the town enjoying yourself<a href=\"https://www.cracked.com/article_47773_12-epic-parties-that-literally-went-down-in-history.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"> into the earliest hours of the morning, </a>you'll know what you're in for today. See, this list of freaky facts is as awesome as a night out, but it comes with the caveat of a not-so-good following day. You won't wake up with a hangover or anything (mainly because you won't be waking up at all). Ooh, that sounded <a href=\"https://www.cracked.com/article_44353_barney-music-director-got-death-threats-over-insufferable-songs.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">like a threat.</a></p><p>It wasn't, we swear. You won't be waking up because that would imply that you actually <a href=\"https://www.cracked.com/article_43022_5-creepy-things-your-body-does-when-you-go-to-sleep.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">went to sleep, </a>when these terrifying little tidbits are scary enough to keep you up all night long. Okay, that was a teensy bit of a threat.</p><h2>28. Atoka School</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/01dca3860650b71b12b2cf557079a3dcb51abf13ec0d2ae4c19e5e34d93d7a2d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F4630c27b8c7caa63601357abfd2558bf.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. ATOKA SCHOOL ARTESIA, NEW MEXICO James H. tells us, &quot;There have been many reports of people hearing crying children and screams even though it's been abandoned for years.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>27. St. Crispin's Hospital</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/df71c56ec5b9bc8f03d67aa9b11d1afd2fa890d746cb58031ddaafd67641a19b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fdf5a4006848c457287226fd848c55dc8.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. ST CRISPIN'S HOSPITAL NORTHAMPTON, ENGLAND Maciei D. told US about the mental asylum that was built in 1976 and closed in 1995. Before it closed, it was used as a filming location for Doctor Who. Since its closing, there's been mysterious fires. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>26. Shanghai Tunnels</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e248b6bc4defbe9f74cdd81ed75c067a2ad5500a8fc88bb13fdebab5f9001cd7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F67d348926fd69ed3a80a7da772a0336b.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. SHANGHAI TUNNELS PORTLAND, OREGON Ron L. says the secret network of underground tunnels is considered haunted, adding, &quot;People touched. Rocks being thrown. Unexplained sounds. Disembodied voices.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>25. Satan School</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7917317273259990a9c92819ad6516eff46857ef93ac00deb735430312a3037b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fd256b1aa0168076a167419435e421c77.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. SATAN SCHOOL Road SHREVEPORT, LOUISIANA Ellerbe Road Ellerbe Road Gregg G. says, &quot;It's an abandoned school building in a remote area. It's rumored to be the place to commit ritual sacrifice, summoning demons, etc. I've heard personal accounts of hearing screaming inside the building, as well as what was described as 'a floating orb of energy.' The building and land is privately owned, it still stands in disarray to the very day, kept under lock and key including trespassing warnings around.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>24. The Bell Witch</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8c0ea25237d893bb4c29be105b3d406dc58c35879b9b7642604a5a4be53ea03b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F8cbd64aba9f44bf0a4e8c554afcca1fe.jpg\" alt=\"Adams, Tennessee THE BELL WITCH CAVE Most caves can be pretty scary, but the legend of a dark witch who tormented the Bell family in the 19th century puts this one right up there. The witch was believed to have hidden away in the cave, making people think she left the area when she never really did. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>23. The Haunted Island</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6e0c93836cecd6cf21088711f46cc367596840e46fcc69329a7bf0dae548b965/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fa953e8bad7b98ac759fe8b0cf2ab626a.jpg\" alt=\"Venice, Italy THE HAUNTED ISLAND Poveglia Island is technically off limits to visitors, and the site was once a home to those quarantined and dying from the bubonic plague. Some believe that the soil is made up of 50% human remains. In 1922, a mental hospital was opened there, and horrible tales of a doctor brutally torturing his patients before jumping out of a bell tower are all part of its legend today. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>22. The Bermuda Triangle</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f6dbbd36d87073e2475f39b188fe30e6c8944841cea8ee5fa68179af3179a9dd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w549_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F0c2c62c39eb4a7c6a0b2daf45539fd6a.jpg\" alt=\"Cluj-Napoca, Romania THE BERMUDA TRIANGLE FOREST The twisted trees of the Hoia-Baciu forest makes it a unique but eerie site. It's also believed to be the most haunted forest in the world. There are tales of people disappearing, claims of alien abductions, and some believe there are ghosts wandering around. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"549\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>21. The City of the Dead</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/769677b23d86d16455ea8d4c62e2a0c43170755c7903c023de77396475c660d2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F63686348d9ab009e7fe78f41506ef69e.jpg\" alt=\"Buenos Aires, Argentina THE CITY OF THE DEAD La Recoleta Cemetery is as impressive as it is morbid, with a tragic legend of a woman who was buried alive and tried to claw her way out of her crypt. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>20. The Chapel of Human Bones</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ead85eb323fc858cb4d81de0170c54f9d88ee14314c7cb05c2053e33b1cfb168/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w549_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F6f5a712d63f2229ae76ccea4cc497899.jpg\" alt=\"Kutná Hora, Czech Republic THE CHAPEL OF HUMAN BONES Back in the 13th century, people regarded the site as holy ground, and everyone wanted to be buried there when they died. When the space filled up, bodies were dug up to make more room, and the bones of more than 40,000 corpses were used to display the dead in full view. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"549\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>19. Winston Churchill</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/deb386a887e8d0fe52cbfa5f5d94ac0f9d0035a99d3dd5742808eb006037ee58/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F4c6c89c901cd6cda3378a7dd4d86ae2e.jpg\" alt=\"CRACKED WINSTON CHURCHILL It's said that during World War II, Winston Churchill had a strange experience in the Lincoln Bedroom of the White House - apparently, he saw the ghost of President Abraham Lincoln. Abe sure does get around in the afterlife.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>18. George V</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5fe8864f72f3c4738a0bc180fcb7fcdcaed172629df70a1936693949b805614a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F815594c092f4d8f49000f6525b380c92.jpg\" alt=\"CRACKED GEORGE V Prince George V, then serving as a midshipman on the H.M.S. Bacchante, saw the legendary ghost ship the Flying Dutchman in Australian waters back in 1881. The Dutchman is a harbinger of doom but, as it happens, the prince survived.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>17. UFO Sightings</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/689c5817625f7224e05375df4bbfc3cb43afbbe74ed5fd8586ead35a9fe58942/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F8ea188a7aafadc7abe7a2d0ee2ba4250.jpg\" alt=\"CRACKED GUILLERMO DEL TORO Guillermo del Toro said he had an encounter with a UFO while he was hanging out with a friend in Mexico. &quot;It was a flying saucer, so clichéd, with lights [blinking]. It's so sad: I wish - - could reveal they're not what you think they are,&quot; he said. OD - Instructional Andress 20 INGMAR BER TURKISH DELIGHT HOUR TOK Going Places 'the positive 21 The Seren alamy and DAY . SAMUR WE DAY FOR NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>16. The Wow Signal</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c52748856c77958691f5bf1eda4d46890b43ee47aec8ef4fefbdd0856686ff2d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w792_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F37d69b94223bf32da0e40d597b40cdf5.jpg\" alt=\"CRACKED 2 1 4 GT 1 1 1 1 2411 12 may 3 1 61 3 1 2 7 1 Wow! 2 31 11 3 1 1 TWIT 1 1 ULCOMO PPW 1 1 4 113 2 1 344111 1 1/2 1/2 1 1 1 1 1 1 برب 1 2 1 1 11 1 AN ODD RADIO SIGNAL In 1977, a radio telescope in Ohio picked up an incredibly strong signal that has never been caught again. Called the &quot;Wow!&quot; Signal, it's one of the most mysterious things ever observed in astronomy, and some suspect it was sent by\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"792\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>15. Ancient Rock Art</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6684b643484d6633e9d7b5ebebe9c76ae21a7dbf1aa9aff7b1931f42698f26de/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w792_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F67fe3c09a286930e6347822508702730.jpg\" alt=\"CRACKED ANCIENT ROCK ART The head of the SETI organization's Interstellar Message Composition suggested that ancient rock art could be a sign of aliens, and that scientists might have trouble recognizing signs of alien life because they could look like something natural.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"792\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>14. May-Stringer Home</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fb647ed1dbcf1a60c89ebeae7cde0856f2b0db930398f3644b4b1bccae2628e3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fec66323c6910b2a7fe073c2d6f90b040.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. MAY-STRINGER HOME BROOKSVILLE, FLORIDA Mona M. tells US of the historic house turned museum, where workers have supposedly heard a crying child, seen glowing orbs, and felt cold spots. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>13. The Witch's Hat</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a432d3db3e49275fb9d07698e497b3eb9ae8712b1acb1f99fb64daa3dcc3c2f8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F06d98272ea226b83eee497fdb21c54f2.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. THE WITCH'S HAT READING, PENNSYLVANIA Justin L. tells US about the observation pavilion, which is the only remains of an old hotel, where there are &quot;lots of local legends about a creepy witch whose ghost appears if you go there at night.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>12. The Menger Hotel</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f58f7118869cdb128c16eff890b54d98c6f060f83df5eab32be68dabe9988d50/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F902df5897ba16a4990393885cdb729fb.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. MENGER HOTEL SAN ANTONIO, TEXAS MENGER HOTEL. Joshua M. says, &quot;Been around so long Babe Ruth and Teddy Roosevelt stayed there. Right next to the actual Alamo, so built on land where literal 1 000s died in the battle. Place is creepy even in the broad daylight.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>11. UFOs</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6c0b100d76de9025284167fedd2c9128f20ec3641009bef9db3f5894725112e2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fa9cc91146e9171e2154acd893fe29196.jpg\" alt=\"The United States Government has confirmed the existence of UFOs. A report released in 2021 confirms the sighting of 144 instances- but doesn't confirm the existence of extraterrestrial life. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>10. The Bake-Kujira</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2ccb12ddc155c869240560efdeffcf87bfd7bfba5a3ba3f394ad378dec27aff4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F389da12b410c43a06dd012a25df518a6.jpg\" alt=\"This is the Bake-Kujira, a skeletal Japanese ghost whale that haunts the seas near whaling villages, and if anyone sees it, it curses their village with fire, plague, famine, and other catastrophes. Japanese mythology doesn't screw around... CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>9. Brazil</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/014004a5effca6ae8699ca017fe391d488bf5ad78c3567d472da5a14cafd6adb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w455_h697%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F79249491f913342e230c2fd665ae4685.jpg\" alt=\"GRACKED.COM This is the Auñ Pana, a Brazilian Piranha-man with arms and fur. They also have magic powers and the ability to turn people into monkeys or pigs, because apparently a regular man-eating fish with arms isn't terrifying enough.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"455\" height=\"697\" /></p></figure><h2>8. Kelpie</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/194203f18663c0453048de0b87acf15429f3282b7c5b8130061f31b6de6b317f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F9fafdbbb08d25260f46b97b93eea5ccb.jpg\" alt=\"Kelpie is a shapeshifting creature in Scottish mythology that lures people to watery deaths. It usually takes the form of a horse to lure exhausted travelers into riding it. Once the traveler touches a Kelpie, though, their hands will be stuck and the Kelpie will ride into the water and drown the traveler. In other instances, Kelpie lures people in the form of a beautiful woman. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>7. Japan</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3503d8a95bae523feed07d04984b7ed1eee4e8d8ea6671ac6866e33216e60619/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fbf63ae323a7ce860a66f9cfe46115314.jpg\" alt=\"A Futakuchi-Onna is a woman who grows a second mouth on the back of her head. The mouth threatens her, cries for food, and causes her pain if it isn't fed. Later, her hair turns into tendrils that scoop food into the mouth. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>6. David Bowie</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/efcfb06070846a023296f23e72f9d092ca9dfdd011e1b86925ed146808e3b1b6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F87700f40152626c718b2538cff2c0fa9.jpg\" alt=\"Myths with real-life consequences Ghosts (that check up on you from the afterlife) According to someoone close to him, David Bowie said his dad's ghost called him every day for a week after he died. It was always at the same time, so he was sure it was his dad WX from beyond. CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>5. Ghosts</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/27a4bc09beecea5ce673a48b4bbe8275b91b38f2bffe06082f444ea48bce4680/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F9f86cb0fe896a950ea7127023b0a5f83.jpg\" alt=\"Myths with real-life consequences Ghosts (that hang out in houses) A &quot;ghost whisperer&quot; checked out Hull, UK's &quot;most haunted house,&quot; and caught some creepy, unexplained noises on camera. Не also felt a presence and heard voices, bangs, and scratching, plus a &quot;hiss&quot; when he lay in a coffin. CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>4. Mexico</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3d847b562ad5ab53af6a03d4393b8bf9db3ff6e4ac09eef19de2c366a5c30f0e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fed15ccc2a119c7eb522df996ad073cc2.jpg\" alt=\"Isla de las Munecas in Mexico's ancient Xochimilco district. to are Seniorin The Island of the Dolls is home to hundreds of mutilated dolls. Their origins are a mystery, but they are said to be possessed by a little girl who drowned in the area. The caretaker of the island was later found drowned in the same spot. CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>3. Fengdu Ghost City</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/62f49ad6421ee71947b0e0b116fd555c1f273959602fc743b4b94dbd0d8766fa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F7c2447d3b3e360dacaa6a8a3f1b54818.jpg\" alt=\"Fengdu Ghost City in China. E le With stone statues of demons desecrating humans, &quot;Ghost City&quot; is seen as the gateway to Diyu (the Chinese realm of hell). It's at the northern end of the Yangtze River, and you can participate in the annual festival that honors the spirits. CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>2. Voodoo</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/800b4fb650d43cb3848ac61a05571d20ba3f95333068f203384f6ed2d2eb91c7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fcb1b0595516223dd3a9a45f8eec68fee.jpg\" alt=\"The New Orleans Voodoo Museum. Many Voodoo tours offer walks through cemeteries, ghost stories, potions, Tarot cards, and authentic Voodoo dolls. The museum itself has objects from Voodoo's most famous practitioner Marie Laveau, and is called &quot;one of the creepiest places on Earth.&quot; CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>1. Acheri</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/257b8ace4e08d2e9769e65aaa4937b7caee6c364669633050d972daa005197f2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w525_h669%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F7822d69412e9af6af6d5dfb2836b625d.jpg\" alt=\"Acheri CRACKED.COM In Native American and Hindu folklore, the Acheri are the spirits of little girls who died horrible deaths. They return and cause children to suffer from a respiratory disease and eventually die. Ward them off with red ribbons.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"525\" height=\"669\" /></p></figure>"
